4838088940622_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fnrr5fqQpNgQ7kNvwH7l6UC&_nc_oc=Adpe6Qmq6xVohlLy-BUEn50XI1BO4s_-ri6nCY2MGdfuXnyLVdgCNQimWA3_Nb9GAD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2ZRJeYfPXKLs2I-QKhzM0Z4fRob4W_ZtrBNmctBHEQYA&oe=69F2095C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_landscape_demo.png", "id": "770227605911247", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822924_770227609244580_3311407269777496338_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Svulcaw_-0UQ7kNvwGp8cnv&_nc_oc=AdrwgX2Em3QYnsiU0Rt3hhA0VVPjqMnx-pkRA3NbUyUm9CU1QqsPgDgiQcza9J7gRd0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2ypwLuNSCqMFm_r2yq2U8u7a_OcQ7ncrP4yXEKiDbXEQ&oe=69F20BE1"}, "display_name": "Rhythm Racket - Demo", "keywords": ["beat", "rhythm", "music", "racket", "swing"], "long_description": "# Swing your racket to the beat!\nI took the badminton mod from Beat Saber and turned it into a full rhythm game! Experience flow as you swing, smash, and return volleys to the beat of the music.\n\nGet the full game here \u2192 https://vr.meta.me/s/1S5C9g6vEST6p3Q\n{1248197004069725}\n{1296455139059008}\n\n# Work up a sweat!\nJust 4 note types and 3 lanes combine to create complex patterns.\n{1985013245383485}\n{1924103911582438}\n\n# 3 soundtracks to try out!\nWith 10+ in the full version!\n{964566906128340}\n\n# Audience reacts to your performance!\nWatch the audience cheer in excitement during perfect swings.\n{955582563645192}\n\n# Aim for a Million!\nAim for a max score of 1,000,000 on each soundtrack to earn M rank.\n{27057277030541176}\n\n# Discover artists with banger tracks!\nFrom rhythm game artists like **t+pazolite** (Arcaea, DEEMO, & Cytus II) and **Nstryder** (osu!, Geometry Dash, & Sound Space).\n{2110782169763378}\n\nNote: Progress does not carry over to full game.", "short_description": "Swing your racket to the beat!"}]}, "developer_name": "Allen Dawodu", "developer_pr